{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204380","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204380","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1220438001:1":{"text":"Stanton—Hey! Your brain didn't get scrambled in the last fight, did it?","source_cn":"斯坦顿——喂！喂喂，你该不会是拳赛的时候受了伤，脑袋发...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3C69741C573C68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220438002:0":{"text":"Who? Ah! You're here... sorry, I spaced out...","source_cn":"……谁？啊！你们来了……抱歉，我、我走神了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1447E8C8051764B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Who? Ah! You're here... sorry, I spaced out...","female":"Who? Ah! You're here... sorry, I spaced out...","variant_male_record_index":"131197","variant_female_record_index":"131198","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1220438002":{"text":"Who? Ah! You're here... sorry, I spaced out...","source_cn":"……谁？啊！你们来了……抱歉，我、我走神了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF1447E8C8051764B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Who? Ah! You're here... sorry, I spaced out...","female":"Who? Ah! You're here... sorry, I spaced out...","variant_male_record_index":"131197","variant_female_record_index":"131198","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220438003:0":{"text":"It's true, I'm worried. I don't know what to do.","source_cn":"确实让我发愁，我不知道该怎么办了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8EFF8252677177C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220438004:0":{"text":"The bookie's men were just here...","source_cn":"庄家的人刚刚来过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA183C31874AA85E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220438006:1":{"text":"What?! Did they hurt you? Threaten you? Hmph, Chippy won't let them get away.","source_cn":"什么！他们动手了吗？是来威胁你的吗？哼，满满绝不会放过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A0402B73E54EBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220438007:1":{"text":"Chippy, calm down, Stanton hasn't finished speaking.","source_cn":"满满，冷静一点呀，斯坦顿还没说完呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6FD49F47AD3C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220438008:0":{"text":"They want me to keep throwing fights and join their organization.","source_cn":"他们要我继续打假拳，还让我加入他们的组织。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF96622D8E0C393","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220438009:0":{"text":"They promised so many things... a better life for my sister and me.","source_cn":"他们说会给我很多很多好处，让我和妹妹过上好日子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC10DE0B3A5935DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1220438010:1":{"text":"Even if they're not as powerful as the Carmine Whispers, they control two-thirds of the underground fight business in Rustport.","source_cn":"虽然不如血薇帮，不过锈锚港的地下黑拳业务，有三分之二都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6659642E196573","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1220438011:1":{"text":"What's the matter, kid, are you tempted?","source_cn":"怎么，小子，心动了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D98B2726C7C297D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220438012:0":{"text":"I'm not sure... honestly, I want to be a real fighter.","source_cn":"我、我不知道……其实，我是想当个真正的拳击手……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27ABBB707EE0304E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220438013:0":{"text":"But they vowed my sister and I would be taken care of...","source_cn":"但他们保证会让我和妹妹都过得很好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7486DAE99704865","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220438014:1":{"text":"They kidnapped your sister, you can't trust them!","source_cn":"那些人绑架过你妹妹，他们的话才不可信呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C5FC1580EDFCCDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220438015:1":{"text":"And actually, we just went to—","source_cn":"其实，我们刚才是去——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CF5BA7D27EE5743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220438016:0":{"text":"Chippy, let him decide for himself.","source_cn":"满满，让他自己决定吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5B9C9B3BDBD794E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220438017:1":{"text":"Huh? But...","source_cn":"诶？可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A94D5F9770C736D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220438018:0":{"text":"We can't choose for you, kid. It's up to you how to fight the next bout, I just need to see the result.","source_cn":"我们不会替你选择。小子，下场比赛怎么打，你自己决定，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135F54C7D7A59F4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220438019:0":{"text":"I... I'll think it over carefully, sir.","source_cn":"我……我会好好考虑的，卢卡先生。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84CDDB1B2550CDB7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I... I'll think it over carefully, sir.","female":"I... I'll think it over carefully, sir.","variant_male_record_index":"131215","variant_female_record_index":"131216","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:24:1220438020:0":{"text":"A new day dawns and the bout is about to commence. Everyone prepares to head to the venue.","source_cn":"新的一天到来，拳赛也即将开始。大家准备前往赛场观战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE564BC769FDD5590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"You seem troubled...","source_cn":"你像是在发愁……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9262B6B2CF27DE8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You seem troubled...","female":"You seem troubled...","variant_male_record_index":"65748","variant_female_record_index":"65749","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1220438005:0":{"text":"Just now, the bookie's men came to see me...","source_cn":"刚才，庄家派人来找我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84259B5979033D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"What's going on?","source_cn":"出了什么事吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1B3EFACEBABE5C9E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's going on?","female":"What's going on?","variant_male_record_index":"65750","variant_female_record_index":"65751","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers